WEBVTT

00:11.640 --> 00:14.230
Hey, kingster! Here's a wish for ya!

00:14.610 --> 00:18.310
Give us power! Power!

00:25.110 --> 00:27.210
Yuke, something's not right.

00:27.210 --> 00:30.200
The spirits are extremely disturbed, too.

00:30.200 --> 00:31.960
Yeah. I can tell.

00:31.960 --> 00:33.750
The air's growing really tense.

00:39.120 --> 00:40.030
A ring?!

00:40.030 --> 00:41.050
It can't be, can it?

00:41.050 --> 00:44.170
You guys put on the rings?

00:45.560 --> 00:48.510
We knew you guys were hiding something,

00:48.920 --> 00:51.640
so we had the king here
teach us how to use them.

00:51.950 --> 00:55.640
Yeah, I can feel the power surgin' in me!

00:55.640 --> 00:57.650
The power... The power!

01:08.160 --> 01:15.120
(I Left My A-Rank Party to Help My Former
Students Reach the Dungeon Depths)

02:29.990 --> 02:35.870
(Episode 15:
Crossing Time)

02:39.120 --> 02:41.620
That's right! This magic formula...

02:41.620 --> 02:41.930
(Multi-Destruct Magic Formula)

02:41.930 --> 02:44.670
It's the Multi-Destruct Magic Formula!
(Multi-Destruct Magic Formula)

02:44.670 --> 02:47.510
They're using the power to grant wishes!
(Multi-Destruct Magic Formula)

02:47.860 --> 02:51.260
Don't you remember when we all talked
about what those rings are?!

02:51.690 --> 02:54.560
I can make everything go my way.

02:54.560 --> 02:55.760
Ain't that awesome?

02:55.760 --> 02:57.770
This is beyond foolish!

02:57.770 --> 03:01.440
And with all these pretty ladies
here, I think I'll enjoy this.

03:01.440 --> 03:04.020
Don't need you, though,
so you can die right now.

03:04.400 --> 03:05.080
Get 'im!

03:05.080 --> 03:06.100
On it!

03:09.030 --> 03:10.530
I won't let you!

03:18.050 --> 03:20.290
Pierce, flash of light!

03:20.290 --> 03:21.370
Energy Bolt!

03:26.600 --> 03:27.800
Paralyze!

03:28.300 --> 03:29.300
(Paralyze)

03:29.550 --> 03:31.910
Wh-What?! How the hell?!

03:31.910 --> 03:34.090
We have the blessing of the gold!

03:34.440 --> 03:37.160
Well, we have the blessing that is Yuke!

03:44.120 --> 03:45.250
What the hell?!

03:45.250 --> 03:46.860
How is this...

03:50.520 --> 03:53.490
Wh-What is this?! What's goin' on?!

04:10.050 --> 04:12.060
So I was right!

04:12.060 --> 04:15.880
Putting on the rings allows the effect
of the Sunset to transform them!

04:15.880 --> 04:16.680
Gather up!

04:17.040 --> 04:19.060
Fullbound's turning into monsters!

04:19.060 --> 04:21.390
We don't know what they'll do.

04:21.390 --> 04:23.020
Prioritize staying safe.

04:23.020 --> 04:24.020
Roger that!

04:24.020 --> 04:25.290
Right, got it!

04:25.290 --> 04:26.690
Physical Enchant!

04:26.690 --> 04:28.440
(Enhanced Arm Strength, Enhanced Leg
Strength, Enhanced Stamina, Glass Shield)

04:33.190 --> 04:34.320
Magic Blade!

04:38.770 --> 04:39.860
Marina!

04:39.860 --> 04:40.870
I'm fine!

04:43.040 --> 04:44.290
Gross...

04:46.290 --> 04:48.670
Stay away from me, please!

04:54.920 --> 04:56.680
Pierce, flash of light!

04:56.680 --> 04:58.050
Energy Bolt!

05:04.520 --> 05:06.270
They regenerate so quickly...

05:08.150 --> 05:10.520
Quit darting around like that!

05:14.050 --> 05:15.420
Sorry we're a bit late!

05:15.420 --> 05:16.360
Lucent!

05:17.000 --> 05:19.290
Now, what's the situation?

05:19.290 --> 05:22.870
The rings turned Fullbound into monsters!

05:22.870 --> 05:24.370
Rune's over there!

05:24.870 --> 05:26.160
Understood!

05:26.540 --> 05:28.340
You heard her, people!

05:28.340 --> 05:31.670
It'll be our job to stop these rogues!

05:35.450 --> 05:39.700
Well, then, let's just have Clover
head on further in, shall we?

05:40.180 --> 05:43.430
You sure got a lot more manly, didn't ya?

05:43.820 --> 05:48.500
Since we're from the same homeland,
I'll finish ya off, Zaccard!

05:49.990 --> 05:52.310
We'll take on each of them in pairs!

05:52.310 --> 05:53.940
Marona, you're pairing up with me!

05:53.940 --> 05:57.200
How excitin' to be paired
up with such a fine man!

06:21.570 --> 06:22.890
Wow...

06:22.890 --> 06:25.130
They've got skills, all right.

06:25.130 --> 06:27.140
Clover is going to get Rune!

06:27.890 --> 06:30.180
If King Vordan interferes,
we'll deal with him.

06:30.180 --> 06:32.520
We're going to rescue Rune
and get out of here.

06:33.280 --> 06:35.000
Yeah! Let's go!

06:35.000 --> 06:35.440
Yeah!

06:35.440 --> 06:35.900
Right!

06:36.900 --> 06:39.030
I'll help with Future Prediction!

06:39.030 --> 06:40.970
If you would, Biblion!

06:45.350 --> 06:48.290
Looks like he's not gonna
just let us run past!

06:48.540 --> 06:50.160
Yeah, I didn't think so.

06:50.160 --> 06:52.040
Move it, king!

06:53.740 --> 06:55.040
Critical Weapon!

06:55.040 --> 06:56.300
(Critical Weapon)

07:02.970 --> 07:04.800
That's some power...

07:07.960 --> 07:10.000
Cam!

07:11.940 --> 07:12.900
He's strong...

07:12.900 --> 07:16.270
I guess that's a dungeon
master for you, right?!

07:16.670 --> 07:17.530
Paralyze!

07:17.530 --> 07:20.780
Slow! Venom! Collapse! Blindness!

07:20.780 --> 07:22.780
(Paralyze, Slow, Venom,
Collapse, Blindness)

07:23.130 --> 07:24.530
Gravity!

07:24.530 --> 07:26.160
(Gravity)

07:31.320 --> 07:33.290
Yuke, your...

07:33.290 --> 07:36.420
I used Lady Persephone's
power to make it stronger.

07:36.760 --> 07:38.920
The effects won't last that long!

07:38.920 --> 07:39.920
Keep up the pressure!

07:41.920 --> 07:44.430
Marina! Incoming! Jump to the right!

07:44.430 --> 07:45.390
Got it!

07:59.810 --> 08:00.990
I'll create an opening!

08:02.900 --> 08:04.450
Meow, meow, meow, meow!

08:07.200 --> 08:09.020
Flames, burn everything to ash!

08:09.020 --> 08:10.430
Fire Concealment Jutsu!

08:12.960 --> 08:14.460
There's my opening!

08:17.840 --> 08:19.460
I'll finish it now.

08:20.010 --> 08:22.090
Supreme god who rules the heavens,

08:22.090 --> 08:24.470
the beginning of all life...

08:24.470 --> 08:27.650
- Immortal one who dies and
returns to life endlessly...
- That's not Grade 7 magic, is it?!

08:27.650 --> 08:30.600
- In thy name, end this old world overrun by evil.
- Has she really reached that level?!

08:30.600 --> 08:32.350
- In thy name, end this old world overrun by evil.

08:32.620 --> 08:35.600
I will now begin the ritual
to start a new world.

08:35.900 --> 08:38.570
Nene! Silk! Marina! Gather up!

08:38.570 --> 08:39.360
Got it!

08:39.650 --> 08:40.230
Okay!

08:40.230 --> 08:41.110
Right!

08:41.490 --> 08:44.870
Come, sun, and grant us
the blessings of fire.

08:45.420 --> 08:48.120
Grade 7 Magic: Flare.

08:58.000 --> 08:59.380
Aqua Veil!

09:01.670 --> 09:03.560
I'll control it better!

09:03.560 --> 09:04.920
Don't overdo it, Rain!

09:05.360 --> 09:08.430
But I have to do what I can.

09:08.430 --> 09:10.050
I'll back you up!

09:10.050 --> 09:11.310
Undine!

09:20.740 --> 09:24.070
Check! Scroll of Fire Resistance!

09:24.070 --> 09:25.190
(Scroll of Fire Resistance)

09:25.530 --> 09:28.450
Okay, Rain! You can release your control!

09:28.700 --> 09:29.880
Okay...

09:29.880 --> 09:31.200
I'm... done...

09:31.590 --> 09:32.700
Rain!

09:45.320 --> 09:46.460
Yuke!

09:54.820 --> 09:56.230
Thank goodness you're safe.

09:56.230 --> 09:58.350
Is everyone all right?

09:58.350 --> 10:00.190
Yes. Are you?

10:00.440 --> 10:01.590
I'm fine.

10:29.010 --> 10:31.470
You okay, Rain?

10:31.770 --> 10:34.050
My head hurts...

10:34.050 --> 10:36.100
And my body won't move.

10:36.680 --> 10:37.980
Refresh Mana.

10:42.310 --> 10:45.230
Have her drink this Mana Potion and rest.

10:45.800 --> 10:46.860
What about you?

10:47.420 --> 10:49.990
I have to destroy the One Gold.

10:50.360 --> 10:51.760
I'll go with you!

10:51.760 --> 10:52.870
Me, too!

10:55.140 --> 10:56.550
Rune, are you okay?

10:56.550 --> 10:58.660
Look at that.

11:00.690 --> 11:02.790
Is it trying to revive King Vordan?!

11:04.690 --> 11:08.420
I don't really want to call on Lady
Persephone's power again, but...

11:08.420 --> 11:09.670
Reject.

11:09.670 --> 11:10.680
(Reject)

11:13.470 --> 11:14.550
Are you all right?

11:14.810 --> 11:17.060
Yeah... I'm fine.

11:17.980 --> 11:19.060
Yuke!

11:21.770 --> 11:24.190
So that's the One Gold?

11:24.520 --> 11:26.770
And it's all over once we break it, right?

11:26.770 --> 11:29.200
Yes, it's the cause of all this.

11:29.200 --> 11:34.450
Once it's destroyed, the magic that maintains
this distorted Glad Shi-im will disperse,

11:34.450 --> 11:38.700
and this dungeon will either
disappear or lose its power.

11:38.700 --> 11:42.040
Yeah, but there's something bothering me.

11:42.040 --> 11:46.210
I'm still trying to figure
out what it is...

11:46.210 --> 11:48.460
but I don't think this is over.

11:49.550 --> 11:54.240
In that case, we will let you handle
the rest while we withdraw.

11:55.050 --> 11:58.100
Master Moria, what brings
you to that decision?

11:58.100 --> 12:00.780
We cannot destroy that thing.

12:00.780 --> 12:05.200
Only a superior Red Mage,
like Yuke, can do that.

12:05.200 --> 12:09.210
Really? Guess there are lots of
things Red Mages can do, huh?

12:09.210 --> 12:12.430
In any case, if he's the
only one who can do it,

12:12.430 --> 12:15.610
I suppose there's no need
for us to stay and watch.

12:15.990 --> 12:18.280
I get the reasoning, but...

12:18.280 --> 12:20.870
He won't turn into a monster, will he?

12:20.870 --> 12:22.130
He'll be fine.

12:22.130 --> 12:24.870
That happened to Fullbound
because they put the rings on.

12:25.360 --> 12:27.130
Well, okay, then.

12:27.640 --> 12:30.710
So, Rune, wanna come with us?

12:30.710 --> 12:31.880
I can't.

12:32.460 --> 12:35.140
You're going to destroy that thing, right?

12:35.890 --> 12:37.730
If so, I'll help you,

12:37.730 --> 12:40.890
but you and I should
take care of it alone.

12:40.890 --> 12:42.640
What do you mean?

12:42.940 --> 12:44.930
I'm the Golden Priestess,

12:44.930 --> 12:46.760
so I can touch it without getting hurt.

12:46.760 --> 12:49.150
I think Yuke will be okay, too.

12:49.150 --> 12:53.950
But anyone else would be drenched in the
twilight and overtaken by the Sunset.

12:53.950 --> 12:55.400
So they can't stay.

12:55.400 --> 12:56.830
Yuke?

12:56.830 --> 13:00.800
If the Golden Priestess says
I'll be fine, it must be true.

13:00.800 --> 13:04.160
And if anything does happen, it should
happen to as few people as possible.

13:04.160 --> 13:05.350
Yuke!

13:06.670 --> 13:10.120
Master, I can't just
pretend you didn't say that!

13:10.120 --> 13:13.510
That's right! Your bad
habit is coming out again!

13:13.510 --> 13:15.520
Wait, wait! I just phrased that wrong!

13:15.520 --> 13:17.930
I'm not trying to sacrifice
myself or anything!

13:17.930 --> 13:19.110
There you go again!

13:19.110 --> 13:20.550
You always do this!

13:20.970 --> 13:23.820
Rune, isn't there anything we can do?

13:23.820 --> 13:25.060
I don't think so.

13:25.390 --> 13:28.940
Yuke is special. You can tell, can't you?

13:29.560 --> 13:30.490
I'll be fine, okay?!

13:30.490 --> 13:31.570
You're right.

13:32.000 --> 13:34.070
I guess that's that, then.

13:35.440 --> 13:38.370
I'll head back and wait for you.

13:38.370 --> 13:40.420
Bring Rune back, okay?

13:40.420 --> 13:41.330
I will.

13:41.580 --> 13:43.570
I'll do my job right.

13:43.570 --> 13:48.210
There aren't many things that only a
jack-of-all-trades Red Mage like me can do.

13:49.100 --> 13:52.660
And if it's to prevent something
as terrible as a culling,

13:52.660 --> 13:56.610
any adventurer should count
himself lucky to do it.

13:56.610 --> 13:57.720
That's not funny.

13:58.270 --> 13:59.340
Sorry...

13:59.340 --> 14:02.100
That means I have no choice
but to accept this, too!

14:02.100 --> 14:04.570
This isn't something worth
getting so upset over.

14:04.570 --> 14:06.980
I've been through my fair share
of tough battles, you know.

14:06.980 --> 14:09.480
That's not the point.

14:11.480 --> 14:16.280
There's no room left for me to hug you,
so I'll head back and wait.

14:16.280 --> 14:20.360
But... when you get back, I
demand a day of Nene time!

14:20.800 --> 14:21.990
Okay, sure.

14:21.990 --> 14:23.620
Wait, "Nene time"?

14:23.620 --> 14:26.680
They sure do love him. What a tight party.

14:26.680 --> 14:29.250
Yet another quality of a hero.

14:29.830 --> 14:31.600
All right. We'll head back.

14:32.130 --> 14:35.630
Okay. Let me treat you to
a drink when I get back.

14:37.450 --> 14:39.880
Just know it will be an expensive one.

14:42.230 --> 14:43.050
Guys...

14:43.050 --> 14:46.680
I'll be back soon. Get the
party ready and wait for me.

14:46.680 --> 14:48.810
Okay. See you soon.

14:49.120 --> 14:50.560
I'm holding you to that!

14:50.560 --> 14:52.440
Don't push yourself too hard.

14:52.440 --> 14:54.060
I believe in you!

14:55.480 --> 14:57.070
Cam!

14:57.070 --> 14:58.740
Be careful!

15:09.460 --> 15:14.460
So you've finally made it
this far, Mr. Yuke Feldio.

15:15.030 --> 15:15.970
Loge...

15:16.460 --> 15:21.970
When you struck down my father,
I succeeded him as king.

15:22.310 --> 15:25.720
And? Are you going to fight me next?

15:26.180 --> 15:28.470
Most certainly not.

15:28.750 --> 15:32.800
The king, the priestess, and the
mage are together once again.

15:32.800 --> 15:35.730
This time, it truly is over.

15:35.730 --> 15:37.460
I see.

15:37.460 --> 15:41.490
You're going to weave the spell
again and end the world this time.

15:43.780 --> 15:44.700
Reject.

15:47.370 --> 15:49.680
You don't need to worry.

15:49.680 --> 15:51.620
I'll keep it under control.

15:52.220 --> 15:54.870
Will the Sunset really
end if I destroy this?

15:54.870 --> 15:58.630
That is the purpose of the king
and the Golden Priestess.

15:59.040 --> 16:03.610
This One Gold has existed
since ancient times.

16:03.610 --> 16:07.100
It has traveled across time
and many worlds,

16:07.100 --> 16:09.940
stolen from them and been
stolen itself over and over,

16:09.940 --> 16:14.610
putting its curse on everything until it
found its way into King Vordan's hands.

16:14.610 --> 16:18.650
That is how it destroyed our world.

16:18.990 --> 16:22.030
Then you're saying this is
what will bring the culling?

16:22.350 --> 16:27.030
Indeed. This stone itself is the Sunset.

16:27.030 --> 16:29.790
I will begin the ritual now.

16:29.790 --> 16:31.790
Are we all ready?

16:32.300 --> 16:36.790
If I am the hero, I have to do
the job expected of a hero.

16:36.790 --> 16:40.330
My wish is for a silent end,

16:40.330 --> 16:42.380
detachment from this world,

16:42.380 --> 16:46.300
and to return to the flow
of all things through loss.

16:46.300 --> 16:51.060
Now, Mr. Yuke, cast the
great magic of fulfillment.

16:57.560 --> 17:01.570
Look after Rune, youth
whose name I do not know.

17:02.430 --> 17:04.400
Right. I will.

17:10.190 --> 17:12.120
A vague prayer...

17:12.700 --> 17:14.310
turns a naïve wish...

17:15.450 --> 17:18.030
into new hope.

17:18.880 --> 17:21.180
Prismatic Missile!

17:29.070 --> 17:32.260
What is this?! It hurts!

17:32.820 --> 17:34.390
You're not going to finish him?

17:34.390 --> 17:37.490
If he could die, he'd be dead by now.

17:37.490 --> 17:38.900
What did you do to me?!

17:38.900 --> 17:42.400
Theoretically, that spell remains
active until the target dies.

17:42.400 --> 17:45.400
That's it... I get it now!

17:45.400 --> 17:49.430
Only those with consciousness will
reach the center of the world

17:49.430 --> 17:50.910
and hear its song.

17:51.300 --> 17:54.410
The wish has now been realized.

17:54.750 --> 17:58.630
I used the power of Persephone's
curse to modify Prismatic Missile.

17:59.450 --> 18:02.800
Yuke! Aren't we friends?

18:06.920 --> 18:11.110
He's going to be stuck here
suffering forever, isn't he?

18:12.310 --> 18:14.340
I made sure of it.

18:16.680 --> 18:17.690
And...

18:20.440 --> 18:23.070
And now I'm going to leave him behind.

18:23.070 --> 18:26.600
Yuke! Yuke!

18:26.600 --> 18:30.950
You've been stuck in
eternity, unable to die,

18:30.950 --> 18:33.130
cursing everything in the world,

18:33.130 --> 18:37.290
until you changed your form
and crossed many worlds

18:37.290 --> 18:38.830
on a long, long journey...

18:39.090 --> 18:40.960
Walk alongside hope...

18:42.080 --> 18:43.820
And this is where you ended up.

18:44.340 --> 18:48.340
So that you might one day reach
the center of the world and sing.

18:48.340 --> 18:50.440
You don't need to suffer anymore.

18:50.440 --> 18:52.800
I'm going to grant your wish now.

18:52.800 --> 18:54.180
Rest in peace.

18:55.430 --> 18:56.320
Wish.

18:57.100 --> 18:58.680
(Wish)

19:04.530 --> 19:08.820
For the Golden Priestess to be set
free and for true happiness.

19:09.160 --> 19:11.290
This is my wish,

19:11.290 --> 19:13.820
my younger brother's wish,

19:13.820 --> 19:17.330
and the wish of the dearly
beloved, beautiful Frya.

19:17.330 --> 19:19.010
I'm sorry.

19:19.010 --> 19:21.580
This is goodbye, Simon.

19:26.690 --> 19:28.820
Has it come true?

19:30.910 --> 19:33.340
The world is disappearing.

19:36.320 --> 19:38.190
Yuke, is this...

19:39.060 --> 19:42.850
I guess Glad Shi-im is returning
to its original form.

19:43.380 --> 19:46.610
"Achromatic Darkness" sure
turned out to be an apt name.

19:46.990 --> 19:52.160
Through the protection of Wish and
the secret arts, I was able to exist

19:52.160 --> 19:55.400
even after crossing dimensions,

19:55.400 --> 19:59.000
but this time, it truly is goodbye.

19:59.000 --> 20:04.630
Loge, was Niberune able to come to our
world without being affected by the Sunset

20:04.630 --> 20:08.810
because you and her father
wished for it so long ago?

20:09.380 --> 20:11.260
That is correct.

20:11.260 --> 20:16.010
Couldn't you have wished for
your own happiness this time?

20:16.300 --> 20:21.150
My happiness lies in the distant past.

20:21.150 --> 20:25.020
I will be going to join Frya now.

20:25.020 --> 20:27.520
Frya? My mom?

20:27.920 --> 20:32.800
Niberune, you must live as your
mother and father could not.

20:32.800 --> 20:38.530
Live a long life, enjoy it to the
fullest, and love without abandon.

20:38.810 --> 20:40.290
Uncle Lo...

20:40.290 --> 20:43.990
I wished as best I could for it.

20:43.990 --> 20:46.510
Even if it was a thing that grew distorted,

20:46.510 --> 20:52.300
my prayer—my wish—has been fulfilled.

20:55.640 --> 20:57.480
Rune, let's head back.

20:57.480 --> 21:01.560
Can I do that? I came from
somewhere else, remember?

21:01.560 --> 21:03.900
None of that matters.

21:03.900 --> 21:05.740
I'm an adventurer,

21:05.740 --> 21:09.460
so I have to complete the quest
your father and uncle gave me.

21:11.720 --> 21:12.570
Right!

21:12.570 --> 21:15.550
Well, let's go. Everyone's worried.

21:15.550 --> 21:16.680
Are they?

21:16.680 --> 21:17.740
Of course!

21:17.740 --> 21:20.310
Let's have Marina make pancakes
for us when we get back.

21:20.310 --> 21:22.580
I'm starving.

22:55.960 --> 22:56.600
(Return From the Twilight, And...)

22:56.600 --> 22:59.990
(Return From the Twilight, And...)
Next time, "Return From the Twilight, And..."

22:59.990 --> 23:00.970
(Return From the Twilight, And...)
